{
  "pack_id": "graham.cp4_games",
  "content_kind": "graham_lines",
  "speaker": "graham",
  "_comment": "Graham lines for Mildew Survey and Mouthfeel (CP4). Slots: {name} {answer}. Not yet voiced (dev TTS/subtitle only).",
  "items": [
    {
      "id": "g.sv_intro.1",
      "category": "sv_intro",
      "text": "It's the Mildew Survey. We asked the public. The public were unavailable, so we're asking you.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_intro.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_intro.2",
      "category": "sv_intro",
      "text": "Time for the Mildew Survey. Your answers are anonymous. Your shame is not.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_intro.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_intro.3",
      "category": "sv_intro",
      "text": "The Mildew Survey. Write what you think. Then judge each other. It's very healthy.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_intro.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_rules.1",
      "category": "sv_rules",
      "text": "I'll ask a question. Type an answer on your device. Then vote for the best one. Not your own. We check.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_rules.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_rules.2",
      "category": "sv_rules",
      "text": "Write an answer. Vote for somebody else's. Some answers come from our archive. Some of the archive is very old.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_rules.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_ask.1",
      "category": "sv_ask",
      "text": "Here's the question.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_ask.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_ask.2",
      "category": "sv_ask",
      "text": "Thumbs ready. Here's what the survey wants to know.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_ask.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_ask.3",
      "category": "sv_ask",
      "text": "This one came in by post. Unsigned.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_ask.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_ask.4",
      "category": "sv_ask",
      "text": "Our researchers asked this question four hundred times. Your turn.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_ask.4"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_winner.1",
      "category": "sv_winner",
      "text": "{name} wins that. \"{answer}\". Lovely.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_winner.2",
      "category": "sv_winner",
      "text": "The room has spoken. {name}. \"{answer}\". I'm not proud of any of you.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_winner.3",
      "category": "sv_winner",
      "text": "That's {name}'s. Of course it is.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_winner.4",
      "category": "sv_winner",
      "text": "{name} takes it. We'll be keeping that one.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_no_votes.1",
      "category": "sv_no_votes",
      "text": "Nobody voted. A survey of silence.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_no_votes.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_no_votes.2",
      "category": "sv_no_votes",
      "text": "Not a single vote. Apathy. Very British.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_no_votes.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_archive_reveal.1",
      "category": "sv_archive_reveal",
      "text": "That one came from the archive. Nobody remembers who wrote it.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_archive_reveal.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_archive_reveal.2",
      "category": "sv_archive_reveal",
      "text": "The archive answer. Some of those are from 1998. Some of them aren't.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_archive_reveal.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_archive_reveal.3",
      "category": "sv_archive_reveal",
      "text": "That was from our archive. Don't ask whose.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_archive_reveal.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_who_said_reveal.1",
      "category": "sv_who_said_reveal",
      "text": "It was {name}. You can see it in the face.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_who_said_reveal.2",
      "category": "sv_who_said_reveal",
      "text": "{name} wrote that. We'll be talking about it later. Or not.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_who_said_reveal.3",
      "category": "sv_who_said_reveal",
      "text": "That was {name}. Of course it was.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_outro.1",
      "category": "sv_outro",
      "text": "That concludes the survey. Results will be shared with nobody.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_outro.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.sv_outro.2",
      "category": "sv_outro",
      "text": "The Mildew Survey. Thank you for your honesty. Some of you should see someone.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.sv_outro.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_intro.1",
      "category": "mf_intro",
      "text": "It's Mouthfeel. The round where you describe things that should never be in your mouth.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_intro.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_intro.2",
      "category": "mf_intro",
      "text": "Welcome to Mouthfeel. Use your words. Your awful, awful words.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_intro.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_intro.3",
      "category": "mf_intro",
      "text": "Mouthfeel. I've done this round for years. I still can't eat soup.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_intro.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_rules.1",
      "category": "mf_rules",
      "text": "I'll name something. You describe how it feels in your mouth. Then everybody votes for the category I give you. I may enter an answer myself. Anonymously.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_rules.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_rules.2",
      "category": "mf_rules",
      "text": "Describe the mouthfeel. Vote on the category. Don't vote for yourself. I'll know.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_rules.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_ask.1",
      "category": "mf_ask",
      "text": "Imagine it. Now describe it.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_ask.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_ask.2",
      "category": "mf_ask",
      "text": "Close your eyes. Open your mouth. Not literally.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_ask.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_ask.3",
      "category": "mf_ask",
      "text": "Picture this between your teeth.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_ask.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_ask.4",
      "category": "mf_ask",
      "text": "Here it is. Take your time. Chew it over.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_ask.4"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_winner.1",
      "category": "mf_winner",
      "text": "{name} wins it. \"{answer}\". I can taste that.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_winner.2",
      "category": "mf_winner",
      "text": "That's {name}'s. Disgusting. Well done.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_winner.3",
      "category": "mf_winner",
      "text": "{name}. Beautifully revolting.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_no_votes.1",
      "category": "mf_no_votes",
      "text": "No votes. You've all lost your appetite.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_no_votes.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_no_votes.2",
      "category": "mf_no_votes",
      "text": "Nobody voted. That's fair.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_no_votes.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_chain_final.1",
      "category": "mf_chain_final",
      "text": "And there it is. Rate it. Be honest.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_chain_final.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_chain_final.2",
      "category": "mf_chain_final",
      "text": "Look what you've made. Rate it on your devices.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_chain_final.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_chain_final.3",
      "category": "mf_chain_final",
      "text": "That's what you've built. Someone has to eat it. Rate it.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_chain_final.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_chain_good.1",
      "category": "mf_chain_good",
      "text": "A masterpiece. Points shared between the chefs.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_chain_good.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_chain_good.2",
      "category": "mf_chain_good",
      "text": "That's genuinely horrible. Well done, all of you.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_chain_good.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_chain_bad.1",
      "category": "mf_chain_bad",
      "text": "Not your best work. Not anybody's best work.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_chain_bad.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_chain_bad.2",
      "category": "mf_chain_bad",
      "text": "Underwhelming. Even the bin doesn't want it.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_chain_bad.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_graham_choice.1",
      "category": "mf_graham_choice",
      "text": "My personal favourite was {name}'s. Graham's Choice. Small bonus.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_graham_choice.2",
      "category": "mf_graham_choice",
      "text": "Graham's Choice goes to {name}. Don't let it go to your head.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_graham_choice.3",
      "category": "mf_graham_choice",
      "text": "I liked {name}'s. That's all. Small bonus.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_outro.1",
      "category": "mf_outro",
      "text": "That's Mouthfeel. Have a glass of water. Have several.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_outro.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_outro.2",
      "category": "mf_outro",
      "text": "That concludes Mouthfeel. Please do not eat any of it at home.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_outro.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_rev_ask.1",
      "category": "mf_rev_ask",
      "text": "I'm going to describe something. You tell me what it is.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_rev_ask.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_rev_ask.2",
      "category": "mf_rev_ask",
      "text": "Here's my tasting note. What am I eating?",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_rev_ask.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_rev_ask.3",
      "category": "mf_rev_ask",
      "text": "Listen carefully. What am I describing?",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_rev_ask.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.mf_rev_final.1",
      "category": "mf_rev_final",
      "text": "Last one. Concentrate. What is in my mouth?",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.mf_rev_final.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_discarded.1",
      "category": "wv_discarded",
      "text": "One answer has been removed. No. We're not putting that on television.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_discarded.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_discarded.2",
      "category": "wv_discarded",
      "text": "We've taken one out. You know who you are.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_discarded.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_altered.1",
      "category": "wv_altered",
      "text": "Charming.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_altered.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_altered.2",
      "category": "wv_altered",
      "text": "I've corrected one of those. You're welcome.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_altered.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_graham_won.1",
      "category": "wv_graham_won",
      "text": "Mine won. Naturally.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_graham_won.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_graham_won.2",
      "category": "wv_graham_won",
      "text": "That was mine. Naturally.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_graham_won.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_graham_won.3",
      "category": "wv_graham_won",
      "text": "That one was me. Thirty years in the business.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_graham_won.3"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_archive_won.1",
      "category": "wv_archive_won",
      "text": "You voted for the archive. Somebody wrote that a long time ago. They'd be pleased. Probably.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_archive_won.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_archive_won.2",
      "category": "wv_archive_won",
      "text": "The archive wins. It usually does.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_archive_won.2"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_match.1",
      "category": "wv_match",
      "text": "Two of you wrote the same thing. That's either telepathy or a worrying sign. Bonus points.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_match.1"
    },
    {
      "id": "g.wv_match.2",
      "category": "wv_match",
      "text": "A match! Same answer, independently. Bonus.",
      "enabled": true,
      "quality_status": "draft",
      "audio": "qwen.g.wv_match.2"
    }
  ]
}
